## Title: |cFFD700Unchained Helper|r
## Description: Blackrose Prison helper for Unchained runs. Spawn markers, wave callouts, sigil blocking, Totem alerts and smart timing, progress tracking, optional cardinal markers, BRP splits, and an optional persistent self-learning colour-coded boss mechanic predictor, and a session-only UI layout preview.
